    {
      "id": "C4",
      "kind": "concept",
      "statement": "BPE可把整串標記登記成atomic special項，但這不自動保护普通內容中相同拼寫；字表、matching/normalization/decoder以及普通／結構編碼契約必須共同保存。",
      "location": "06.md#6.6 第6段及補充第1段",
      "scope": "Hugging Face tokenizers 0.23.2與本課原BPE的具體契約。不是說每種BPE／每種特殊token格式都有同一ID規則。",
      "status": "verified",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "hf_added",
          "locator": "AddedToken11–99；add_tokens265–350；find_matches430–490；split_with_indices494–522；extract_and_normalize531–577",
